origin, destination, GET /cheapest returns 200 with cheapest FlightResult; returns 404 when SkyscannerClient returns empty array, GET /search with valid params returns 200 { flights, count, searchedAt } where count === flights.length and searchedAt is ISO-8601, RAPIDAPI_KEY absent → /search and /cheapest return 503 { error: 'RAPIDAPI_KEY not configured' }; /health and / still return 200, SkyscannerClient throws → /search and /cheapest return 500 { error: string } without crash, @jest/globals, jest.mock, ./client, ./skyscanner, hardcoded HTML content, fs.readFile, fs/promises

